        "description": "Personal or family history of bleeding symptoms consistent with coagulation defect",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Prolonged PT with reduced Factor VII activity level below 50%, with or without confirmatory genetic testing",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires exclusion of acquired causes of Factor VII deficiency."
  },
